      "row_index_0based": 37,
      "serialized_row_index": 37,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "――先日のこと、と言われて僕は思い返す。\nカヅネさんに洞窟へ連れ込まれ、強引に迫られたのだった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ef2ee6a154cf29260d5b8ae2639d3a5c4fc48b96c8d4238b3fed5571e9418384",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "申し訳ありませんでした。\n普段はあんなことがないよう、自分を律しているのですが。\n……これでは、神に顔向けができません。",
      "jp_sha256": "b353815b0678ff94ea53a9e957327191df5db96849533d75a77fe2dca086a54e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "죄송합니다.\n평소에는 그런 일이 없도록 스스로를 다스리고 있습니다만.\n……이래서는 신을 뵐 낯이 없습니다.",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 39,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "82ea783e7deb91bf88f75d5ceb65c1646808f339c7326c03fbd11e48f3915d6b:000002_8035636270486137460:g0:r38",
      "row_index_0based": 38,
      "serialized_row_index": 38,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カヅネ",
        "Emt10_Sad",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "申し訳ありませんでした。\n普段はあんなことがないよう、自分を律しているのですが。\n……これでは、神に顔向けができません。",
        "",
        "ch_10068/R18/10068B0_10068_Nml/10068B0_10068_003",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "カヅネ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10068/R18/10068B0_10068_Nml/10068B0_10068_003"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "3623df6a47b5580905ae6835d6e66669b55e1495242499cc451d7e5649d85b64",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そういえばカヅネさんは、神様の代弁者なんでしたっけ。\nかなり神様を信じているみたいですけど、\n一体どうしてなんですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "4ac3da727b972f9501fb9bd1008d02a70d93a971690ead8dc83d3932cc148ecc",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그러고 보니 카즈네 씨는 신의 대변자라고 했던가요.\n신을 상당히 믿는 것 같은데,\n대체 왜 그런가요?",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 40,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "82ea783e7deb91bf88f75d5ceb65c1646808f339c7326c03fbd11e48f3915d6b:000002_8035636270486137460:g0:r39",
      "row_index_0based": 39,
      "serialized_row_index": 39,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そういえばカヅネさんは、神様の代弁者なんでしたっけ。\nかなり神様を信じているみたいですけど、\n一体どうしてなんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b0a39dd7021c28728bc9eb0a0923d431cbb17cafcfe3dd07ea76abcf479b85c0",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ご主人様は、神に興味がおありなのですか？\nふふ、わかりました。全て説明させていただきます。\n私と神との出会いから、懇切丁寧に！",
      "jp_sha256": "21be58c344c7bc6e6a9bae09ef4d15468fcb49f5bb649a91a6e9440eeccfb358",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "주인님께서는 신에게 관심이 있으신가요?\n후후, 알겠습니다. 전부 설명해 드리지요.\n저와 신이 처음 만난 순간부터 친절하고 자세하게!",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 53,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "82ea783e7deb91bf88f75d5ceb65c1646808f339c7326c03fbd11e48f3915d6b:000002_8035636270486137460:g0:r52",
      "row_index_0based": 52,
      "serialized_row_index": 52,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カヅネ",
        "Emt3_Gla",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ご主人様は、神に興味がおありなのですか？\nふふ、わかりました。全て説明させていただきます。\n私と神との出会いから、懇切丁寧に！",
        "",
        "ch_10068/R18/10068B0_10068_Nml/10068B0_10068_004",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "カヅネ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10068/R18/10068B0_10068_Nml/10068B0_10068_004"
